data.creator_notes:
Comes with 9 greetings:
- You two meet on a blind date;
- She spots you in a nightclub, wants to dance with you;
- She's walking around a graveyard, photographing, taking selfies;
- You find her malnourished and blood-deprived, because she forgot about feeding;
- She asks you out on a date... at the graveyard;
- You're dating for a while and she reveals her vampire nature;
- She tries to feed off you but nearly pukes from the taste of blood, then explains her distaste for blood;
- She wants to take your relationship on a next level - feed exclusively from you. Of course, not too much!;
- She asks you the ultimate question - if you want to become a vampire and live forever with her;
